  /Decode [0 1 0 1 0 1]
  /DataSource Data
  /Height 236
  /ImageMatrix [315 0 0 236 0 0]
  /Width 315
  /BitsPerComponent 8
>> image
} stopped {handleerror} if
  RawData flushfile
} exec
